OL,3,GNEWSA'Dishonest' paedophile 'still
OL,4,Aneeds monitoring'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "dishonest" and "manipulative"
OL,7,Fpaedophile still needs monitoring
OL,8,Falmost 20 years after being convicted
OL,9,Fof child sex offences, a judge has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FGordon Bishop, 45, who was jailed for
OL,13,Fmaking indecent images of children in
OL,14,F2007, was back in Newcastle Crown Court
OL,15,Fafter failing to get permission from
OL,16,Fpolice to install the messaging app
OL,17,FTelegram on his phone.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
