OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Dishonest' paedophile 'still
OL,4,Aneeds monitoring'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBishop, from Hetton-le-Hole,
OL,7,FSunderland, was jailed for 16 months
OL,8,Fsuspended for two years after he
OL,9,Fadmitted breaching a sexual risk
OL,10,Fprevention order.
OL,12,FJudge Robert Spragg said the public
OL,13,Fwould "likely be better served in the
OL,14,Flong-term" if Bishop continued to work
OL,15,Fwith the authorities to address his
OL,16,F"issues".
